WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.157
This query creates a long monthly product summary.

00:00:03.157 --> 00:00:06.182
Each row represents one product-month.

00:00:06.182 --> 00:00:11.257
The time dimension, category dimension, and measure stay in separate columns.

00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:18.282
This shape is flexible for charting because new products become new rows instead of requiring new columns.

00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:24.742
Long and wide are not labels for good and bad design; they are shapes suited to different tasks.

00:00:24.742 --> 00:00:29.877
Long data is often easier for grouping, plotting, and scalable storage.

00:00:29.877 --> 00:00:35.827
Wide data is often convenient for human-readable reports or some modeling interfaces.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:38.667
Choose the shape required by the next step.
